                    <p><strong>Definition:</strong> USD-denominated account at US bank/fintech (Mercury/Relay/Wise Business) opened by Indian resident without US travel. Enables USD payments, Stripe/PayPal integration, ACH transfers, and US marketplace payouts.</p><p><strong>Business vs Personal:</strong> Business accounts (Mercury/Relay/Wise) require US LLC/C-Corp + EIN. Personal (Zolve/Vested) for individuals travelling/studying in US.</p><p><strong>For Delhi:</strong> Solves the critical bottleneck - receive USD without 3-7% intermediary fees, SWIFT delays, or PayPal Indian account limitations.</p>

