                <div class="highlight-box" style="margin-top:20px;">
                    <p><strong>Key Terms for US Bank Account in Delhi:</strong></p>
                    <p><strong>EIN:</strong> IRS 9-digit tax ID. Mandatory for Mercury/Relay/Wise Business. Form SS-4, 7-14 days for non-residents.</p><p><strong>LRS:</strong> RBI Liberalised Remittance Scheme. $250K/year. Via Delhi AD bank (SBI/HDFC/ICICI) with Form A2.</p><p><strong>TCS 20%:</strong> S.206C IT Act. On LRS >Rs 10L. Prepaid tax credit (claimed in ITR). Not extra cost but cash-flow impact.</p><p><strong>W-8BEN/W-8BEN-E:</strong> IRS form certifying non-US residency. Exempts from US withholding on interest.</p><p><strong>FATCA/Schedule FA:</strong> US bank reports to IRS → India via CRS. Must declare in ITR Schedule FA annually. IT Act 2025.</p>

